a billion dollar company.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.380
How about just building
a company that you like

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.443
and makes you happy?

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.950
How about just doing
something you like every day?

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.249
Everybody's gotta, right?

00:21:11.249 --> 00:21:12.317
(audience applauding)

00:21:12.317 --> 00:21:13.150
Like how about that?

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:19.970
