job just to pay for shit

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.530
that they have to impress other people

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:35.923
that they don't even like.

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:39.277
How about that fucking conversation?

00:21:39.277 --> 00:21:43.030
(audience applauding)

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:45.200
It has never been easier.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:48.280
And I don't like using the word
