00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.690
It has never been easier to make

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:53.530
a $100,000 a year because of this.

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:57.131
The problem is everybody thinks
you have to make a billion

00:21:57.131 --> 00:21:59.510
and the problem is nobody has humility

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:02.023
to live a $100,000 lifestyle.

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:09.010
I think we have to change the
conversation in our society.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:13.320
Not in Southeast Asia, not
in Malaysia, not in America,

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:15.520
