00:22:45.919 --> 00:22:48.250
and that's what is good for them,

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:50.313
we have to allow for everything.

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:53.440
We have to allow for everything,

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:57.060
because everything is true
and everything is real

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.059
and you need to figure out,

00:22:59.059 --> 00:23:03.040
my biggest fear of my
popularity is that you think

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:04.363
