my version of me makes me.

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:18.230
I want to remind everybody
here I'm 43 years old,

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:22.010
which means when I loved
entrepreneurship in America,

00:23:22.010 --> 00:23:24.420
