00:26:35.480 --> 00:26:38.250
to post it on Instagram and say buy it.

00:26:38.250 --> 00:26:41.670
The problem is most people when they give,

00:26:41.670 --> 00:26:43.200
they give with expectation

00:26:43.200 --> 00:26:45.450
that they're gonna get
something in return.

00:26:45.450 --> 00:26:48.083
That is the non definition of giving.

00:26:48.960 --> 00:26:50.750
When I give, I give.

00:26:50.750 --> 00:26:52.520
And if it doesn't mean that,

00:26:52.520 --> 00:26:54.287
when I wrote Jab, Jab,
Jab, Right Hook I said,

00:26:54.287 --> 00:26:56.380
"Give, give, give, and then ask."

00:26:56.380 --> 00:27:00.023
The way everybody heard it
give, give, give, and then take.

00:27:01.440 --> 00:27:03.333
We have to slow down.

00:27:04.330 --> 00:27:07.470
If you actually thought about
your life in a 50 year window

00:27:07.470 --> 00:27:10.920
or a 80 year window you would slow down.

00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:12.680
Everybody wants to succeed so fast

00:27:12.680 --> 00:27:15.330
'cause they want to prove
something to somebody else.

00:27:16.370 --> 00:27:18.383
That makes you vulnerable.

00:27:19.540 --> 00:27:21.303
That makes you vulnerable.

00:27:22.900 --> 00:27:25.570
When you're producing for more likes,

00:27:25.570 --> 00:27:28.070
when you're producing
for more subscribers,

00:27:28.070 --> 00:27:30.170
when you're producing for more money,

00:27:30.170 --> 00:27:32.550
when you're producing for more fame,

00:27:32.550 --> 00:27:33.803
it makes you vulnerable.

00:27:35.180 --> 00:27:37.830
Produce to bring value to the other party

00:27:37.830 --> 00:27:42.830
so much so that it guilts them
into doing business with you.

00:27:44.260 --> 00:27:45.630
I mean it.

00:27:45.630 --> 00:27:47.650
You want to really build
something meaningful?

00:27:47.650 --> 00:27:52.650
Think about producing content
in a way that is so valuable

00:27:53.630 --> 00:27:56.163
that it guilts people
to do business with you.

00:27:57.630 --> 00:28:02.313
That is how I see brands that win, win.

00:28:02.313 --> 00:28:04.220
